<h2>Default Values</h2>

<p>
    Setting default values makes agents easier to use:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Pre-fill common choices</strong> – Users can accept the default or change it if needed</li>
    <li><strong>Reduce typing</strong> – Especially useful for frequently used values</li>
    <li><strong>Provide examples</strong> – Defaults can show users what format is expected</li>
</ul>

<p>
    <strong>Examples of good defaults:</strong>
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Date parameter: Today's date or a date 30 days from now</li>
    <li>Toggle parameter: Most common choice (usually "No" or unchecked)</li>
    <li>Text parameter: A helpful placeholder or example text</li>
</ul>

