<h2>Troubleshooting</h2>

<h3>Parameter Not Getting Value</h3>
<ul>
    <li>For hidden parameters, verify the page context has the data you need</li>
    <li>Check that the preset is configured correctly</li>
    <li>Ensure the parameter type matches the data type</li>
    <li>Test from different pages to see if the issue is context-specific</li>
</ul>

<h3>Wrong Value in Parameter</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Review the preset or context source—it might be pulling from the wrong place</li>
    <li>Check that the page has the expected data available</li>
    <li>Verify parameter mappings in actions</li>
</ul>

<h3>Required Parameter Missing</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Ensure required parameters have values before the agent runs</li>
    <li>Check if the parameter should be hidden and pulled from context</li>
    <li>Verify the page context provides the needed data</li>
    <li>Consider making the parameter optional if it's not always needed</li>
</ul>

